flowchart LR
  U[User task] --> H
  subgraph H[Secure host - ports & adapters]
    direction TB
    L[Verifying loader<br/>Ed25519 manifests + impl digest] --> R[(Tool registry)]
    T[Token service<br/>macaroon caveats, TTL<=300 s] --> C
    M[Model port<br/>fake / Ollama] -- proposes tool call --> P[PEP: parse once,<br/>schema check]
    P --> C[Capability check<br/>caveats vs args]
