    D -- high risk --> A[Approver port<br/>human yes/no]
    D -- allow --> X[Execute tool]
    A -- yes --> X
    X --> G[Tag output<br/>untrusted_data]
    G -- data, not instructions --> M
    P & D & A & X --> AU[(Audit: hash chain<br/>+ signed checkpoint)]
  end
  S[MCP tool server<br/>lesson 10 stdio] -. tools/list pinned .-> L
  X --> W[(World: docs, files,<br/>recorded effects)]
